{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-09",
  "title": "舊日之影",
  "storyCode": "10-10",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "391242d1d49f984860cfafbfe6b7d450aeecbc78d5e5d8715e7314491b7ba0d5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能讓你露出這麼驚訝的表情，我多少有些意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟，我給過你提示了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你該不會是說那顆石子吧？這種不合時宜的念舊笑話讓我一點都笑不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為來的會是誰？曼弗雷德嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我是在想，特雷西斯會留你一命，還讓你在倫蒂尼姆四處跑，他是不是也老糊塗了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你們這麼長時間沒有聲音，我還當你們早就死透了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔......是我想當然了。你看，你說得沒錯，我確實變得......太多愁善感，以至於一時忘記了，我們都不過是雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你引爆炸彈的速度變慢了，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你這次手沒有發抖呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你從整合運動帶走的那些雇傭兵呢？難道你真是一個人來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶他們來，然後讓他們跟你一樣，被攝政王收買，反過來給我一堆驚喜嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很為他們著想。難怪，我沒有看到更多熟悉的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就不一樣了，在倫蒂尼姆，我可是見到了很多老熟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還是老樣子，真的很愛從我手下挖人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我猜一猜，施瓦布果然已經死了吧？是你親手殺了他嗎，赫德雷？那傢伙認識你，比認識我還要久，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殺死一個曾經背著你走了一天一夜，躲過了十幾個特雷西斯派來的殺手的老朋友，你握劍的手有沒有抖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你記錯了。護衛羅德島號的時候，他已經離隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，關於這些一起打過仗的人，你的記性一向比我好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就想問了，記住這些死掉的人，會讓你更安心一些嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜並不會，赫德雷，你的表情告訴我，你最近做的噩夢比當年加起來還要多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W，我認識你的時間和你認識我的時間一樣長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當你試圖變換角度挑起我的情緒的時候，你只不過是想掩飾你自己內心的波動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，你又知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "換作以前的你，一定會毫不猶豫地把那幾個拖後腿的反抗軍抓過來，當作送給我們的活餌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是有人告訴我，W自願留下殿後——我一定會告訴他，這個笑話一點都不好笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在切爾諾伯格核心城的那段經歷讓你徹底瘋了嗎，W？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是塔露拉燒壞了你的大腦，還是你自己出現了一些不該出現的幻覺，在某個人身上看到了死去已久的影子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瘋子不會承認自己瘋了的，是吧？你怎麼知道，瘋了的人是我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯的信任沒那麼廉價。施瓦布的腦袋遠遠不夠格。你還加了多少碼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你該不會是把她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說這樣的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔......反應這麼大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經做到了所有能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W，是你耽擱得太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒聽錯吧，你是想為自己的無能找藉口？那時候是誰跟我說自己都打算好了的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為，我是在什麼時候失去了一隻眼睛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你是說，伊內絲她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，她死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......又來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇傭兵會為失信付出代價，而我已經付出了我的代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g8_jail"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我們這一路上運氣是不是有點好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲士兵都被南邊的爆炸吸引過去了，在審訊室附近看守的那幾個還被深池提前幹掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在戰場上相信運氣的人一般都不會有什麼好下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，要不是莫名其妙的好運氣，你怎麼可能活到現在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_423_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......她是誰？他們幾個也是從審訊室逃出來的？是......是友軍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（瞄準。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但是......先不要開火。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你每次見我的時候都要舉著弩嗎，士兵？別以為我不知道，你們剛才可是一路跟著我們，才順利地走到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想聽我感謝你？那你得跟我去倫蒂尼姆最深的監獄裡走一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，我都快有些佩服你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你跟其他那些滿身肥油，只配被倒在下水道裡沖走的貴族不太一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了保住以前那種生活，他們可以跪倒在任何人腳下。薩卡茲......或者深池，對他們來說並沒有差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你......你就是不肯放棄，你就跟最討厭的飛蟲一樣，不管我走到哪裡，你都會冒出來礙我的眼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在礙眼這一點上，彼此彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......咳咳咳......蔓、蔓德拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這位朋友傷得可不輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身邊那些士兵也沒好到哪裡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我們都需要趕時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真可惜，今天我沒工夫與你糾纏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩讓道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，士兵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我的石頭刺穿你之前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最好不要死在薩卡茲手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......號角，他們真的又走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......正好，我們還得把彈藥留給薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不也覺得我們的行動順利過頭了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論深池從審訊室裡帶走的是誰，我都不覺得薩卡茲會那麼容易地放過他們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——以及我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海蒂女士，你們的人都撤出來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，阿米婭，大家都在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海蒂女士，讓體弱的人走在最前面，我們會處理掉追上來的雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特先生，你們還能戰鬥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老比爾，抓緊點好嗎？待會動起手來可能會有些晃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，前面也有敵人！應該是從另一個入口處過來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發現目標！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，快過來，幹掉他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，可別跑得比我們還快。走路不看後面的話，也會摔跤的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還漏了幾個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是還沒打過癮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，先幹掉那個術師。萬一他往我們的傷患身上扔點什麼法術，就很難辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，摩根，達格達，你們回來了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，博士，我們來得不算太晚吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "正好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我放心了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......倒是你，博士，你可沒跟我說，來接應我們的只有一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一個人夠了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你知道嗎，博士，越是瞭解羅德島，我就越覺得羅德島神秘......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "當然，不管我見到多少神奇的幹員，最神秘的人一定是你呀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "其實不止一個。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "果然......你一定會留後手的，是吧？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "在這一點上，我們是一樣的人呢。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，薩卡茲士兵看起來是被引到這邊了，但我們這一路上也沒看到太多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在裡面替我們拖著敵人的那幾位朋友......要不是特別厲害的話，一定會很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，我有些擔心W小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W？你是說那個很多去過切爾諾伯格的幹員念念不忘的W嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......羅德島上還真是人才濟濟啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......暫時是合作夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，她說有事要找海蒂女士的時候，她的眼神不太對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你感覺到了什麼，阿米婭？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她不是一直那副樣子嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的情緒......是比一般人特殊一些。但她在有些時候並沒有刻意偽裝，在那些時刻，她的眼神騙不了人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次她露出那種眼神，還是在她嘶吼著問我要停下核心城的金鑰的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......她是不是還有什麼別的話沒說出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等她回來，你可以問問她。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她可是W。她一定還會回來。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的......這一次，我也願意相信她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你流了很多血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身上也破了好幾個洞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該和過去一樣，在身上多藏一顆炸彈的。那樣的話，你至少有一次與我同歸於盡的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的人頭值多少錢？夠你在倫蒂尼姆買一座小房子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，W。攝政王不會記住像你這樣的雇傭兵的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......你也是這麼對伊內絲說的嗎？在她為你們倆的小小夢想掉腦袋之前？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都這種時候了，你還是這麼嘴硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢？為你們倆的愚蠢大笑兩聲外加鼓鼓掌嗎？你別指望在我臉上找到一點傷心的痕跡，赫德雷，那太不像我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......愚蠢的人到底是誰？倒在這裡的人是你不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都說過了，我只是......嗯，有一點小小的驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "驚訝到錯過三四次炸斷我手腳的機會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這才真的不像你，W。是什麼讓你亂了陣腳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，本來以為死了的老朋友原地復活，還想著捅我幾劍，這還不夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這句話聽著倒沒那麼假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W，你說的這位老朋友......到底是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是......討厭你這一點。你和她一樣，總以為能看穿我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，這一次我依然沒判斷錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你潛入倫蒂尼姆有一段時間了，會讓你如此心神恍惚的人和事還沒那麼多。你究竟在城內看到了什麼，W？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你跟著特雷西斯，不是我。難道你跪在他的假王座面前的次數還不夠多，以至於你還沒來得及看清楚他耍的把戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確實知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別再跟我玩什麼你知道我知道什麼的猜謎遊戲了。拿出點雇傭兵的樣子吧，赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能讓你活著離開這裡，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我殺死的這麼多熟人中，我相信......你會是最能理解我的選擇的那一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......到底是誰變得更優柔寡斷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是要狠狠瞪著你，看清楚是哪個薩卡茲敢把劍捅進我的心臟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見了，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的劍......被擋下了？那是......匕首？從哪裡飛過來的匕首？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不見，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也別動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，要不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等，你是來救我的，我沒有理解錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會吧，你該不會是想幫他？難道你不知道特雷西斯對她做了什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是最好扔得更用心一些？我現在可是重傷，差一點就躲不開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那倒是挺可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道你殺不掉我了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你當過我的頭兒，我也當過你的頭兒，可是這裡有一個人，她當過我們倆的頭兒。而且現在，她明顯心情不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。我們倆的人頭在下一刻都可能落地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......我無話可說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你每多說一句話，血就會流得更快一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道啦，多謝關心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來......如果不想一起死在這裡的話，你就得忍受這一次小小的失敗了，赫德雷“隊長”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
